{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1543,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b96f1dc57daeb0b16c0abcc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级提升了呢。\n你的努力结出了成果…\n我也非常高兴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "064998033bf67825cf92de832ccb45d04d1caa69cab01af72323adb7e0cd8671",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14b85f9651833f7ff48f06f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢设计简洁的服装。\n穿上后总觉得背脊会挺直，\n连心也变得澄澈起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6f85309bb2186672474a16b07b2b37339d73bce65bd67fecfa2733cfe849093",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d9882341a4920a57f80da45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在电车上经常会和邻座的人聊天。\n哪怕只是短短几句话，\n也会觉得彼此的心靠近了…很开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "420cebade8ee9a575a0b3af556f1b58f8b1dc26282c60f98ad896158a4cef170",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2d8ad3886fb6556a2056a92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "休息日我常常会去逛美术馆。\n尤其会被以希望和光为主题的画作\n深深吸引。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d081dd80869e188ad7255482002ecc7b1277f43df9851e40136e6974a9efde83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7a4cdcf0d4c75046ca56274",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次再一起跑吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "530ed84e0582e9a0cbb9d7a32b8348282a815715ae7c323bf067c746b5aff5f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1896387f26e398b97388e127",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是我们的胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df40836527fa18e0f0dd5666950e1463686e6432d814f80a0d2367da2797d2ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:925bf8c95faebfe4d72238ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次我不会输的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5fa7540555444c82759f24414deaab44863314206951ba3154973181096edf4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:869df34b9033b3c7df178071",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次再一起跑吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "530ed84e0582e9a0cbb9d7a32b8348282a815715ae7c323bf067c746b5aff5f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a281d067a5c2b6fc3fc6ad30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刷新纪录了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbd54b5d65ed7ad95de265a239cd7e0357feca6ed137778f4af2090df7519eb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d15e8f4b08d3905fa4f1b5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们一同连结吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8383376008e49813ed0e63f72d4ea4e7119fbe1ed14941a5419a2d7e67601e8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4900b050db5e2074b22d56e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2efea544bdb85034d353bab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要进行怎样的训练呢？\n如果有想尝试的菜单，\n请告诉我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4280a227443b91f56c2ae979209e086639f381f0be3150f29c9165b6cb63ae19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20d0154d3f108f7ff96129b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在这所学园中累积起来的\n无数牵绊…。我想感受一下\n那份温暖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "581b6181f013f1bb20105088613b86417d0fede7638ecb19271f8766846e166b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e5744f0feedce1c9b45803c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你是在准备出赛吧。\n愿你的心意，\n能连结到好的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b391e6ddecd129903a4534a1c842c0c4d276f56cb940a3e18e16831075ae3262",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b575c3500d296bf18c472dc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f15c100e8261a112083484a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会连结起来。也连同大家的心意——",
      "source_fingerprint": "f89af9d2d15830de4aff40d611ff15724494ed9eb37ffc88a35b1d5fa2cdd5ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96751c8476c389703fbb23de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望之光——",
      "source_fingerprint": "b61f4ac9b3c66ca5fc3fd95b45b14007c5860d43190a0719140defdfbc106ad8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "1260"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:733f71caeba6c5a10ca29c85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将心连结起来……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "267de4b0e412bea961733398901acbdce0231ffcdeeb04e36d45184d2ce356e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "1261"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:332f3c9000b37a84fcf17fd4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是今天的登录奖励哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "31ad862afe505f7a0e3caf5d40108bddc33091f1c5054820028b7df74bd09a65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:284f53501faff6dc26c8492b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拜托了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69dce43a1e83db8317414d94819a56690e2f8869762928420aca26a49bd4a3fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3a51429caf7ae6b11264eb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，真精彩呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "139cb945baffad055ccf5e415bfd67947a3ee6c44e99c8bc22ecda433572c96b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbb5c80c402a91bde32d5b92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "160d02f9733e54748c323b42843a35e366d7b110517032d612ec579384bf2291",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d92cccde3f9d57edc12c422",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迎来了很多呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a46be6477fac6b586f5a9988bfe916a284f309c0c627052f92c5987512704cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf09fc60b3197ce27ec3337f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真厉害呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e906b92b0bc02fa9bb2c2bc706bf6db0b1a3f255f69e13158eb59edd432cad2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "140004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0158d83a1e9ef34e48e736a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请不要太失落。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2aa4ee06f95007fa8d6771bd9a68a6556445c52ccc3ecdfab86b19b5d874d7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "140005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:879253825f6444aaff70ffcf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迎来了很多呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a46be6477fac6b586f5a9988bfe916a284f309c0c627052f92c5987512704cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "140006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8531700396d307a429e85e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真厉害呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e906b92b0bc02fa9bb2c2bc706bf6db0b1a3f255f69e13158eb59edd432cad2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "140007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aea9120adc85c49b2ca98c5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c261f8470e6b951068e0d77063c43fa4dad0595f35b1742681492d1a2f963251",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "140008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:025329735eb617b51556ae0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c261f8470e6b951068e0d77063c43fa4dad0595f35b1742681492d1a2f963251",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "140009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0cbda9b1f9cea5b2798c71c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "626ba48f2e38a2cc019590d7925bf444771a426356237ab425beb0f36f8d2852",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "140010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b51550af3ce9ed4b4e2ab097",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好厉害…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4171fea5297955ee74bf063ebbf4e44837a2de20e3c743747e9fd71a53675a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "140011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f5fd45cc6c67544dd2dff63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇，这么多…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f9a44e8f6f74a8ed1cb5f17afaae73c78ad093093ecbe4b86e8986a58d45467",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "140012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d72e1496d585ee0f4a82135",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好厉害，一下子就…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc574b10cd147d48386c027cf000433d0d00378a358b11d529e9e8460e7b41f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "140013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a33bc4f0d2a2723416b4704b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "971e447a960a0ee0a628076c22f27d5ee86ce266d1598843dbba7f284c5cf7ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "140014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b20428870fab8d7301dc0f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4e8d20aa5151334b4c38a65a505a9374b636972b6acc835853e25c1ff32890f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92e9afdeb83620d07ba1d6fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该怎么办呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab7a0aaa505af33b601d581a74b6d7710d11141e6c42de6d48191bd537c1ac1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0255b869cd0f52d208b64fcb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "160d02f9733e54748c323b42843a35e366d7b110517032d612ec579384bf2291",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36818cd21325ffce499c4283",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真遗憾…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc83252398a8683dd77581e2015b0e71fee08885f158554526f06b5b263707e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b9ca488b7d0305944c440d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天好像是这个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80998a61896339987423e4cc631bb178892822bed387f2617507f22cc022cf68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5f1c124cc1c84837569fc67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦？我的脸色看起来不好…吗？\n谢谢你的关心。\n你的温柔，给了我很大鼓励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f4c349dda2ba7f229a3a288ab88620ac5af035eea4c238f00423beeca48af88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9e40a0a13a959c862e2ebee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然…我可能有些发呆了…。\n今天早上，也把鞋带\n系成了奇怪的样子…",
      "source_fingerprint": "c06f593466b1d7c89b2c8e8acdaba2b1124f4fac07d178c4ce2c8689d9de4115",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12b4f2b0e3e30d705aa4dc53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总觉得，力量涌了上来…呵呵。\n也许是某个人的声援，\n传达到我这里了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e5ca9a53db4e47373e1cbdb703ed6f768a3b9b7e591dbdbe842c72eecebb16b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90d0a86e99e52dbd26da03fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "稍微跑了一下，感觉腿脚\n比平时更轻…。今天，我想试试\n各种不同的跑法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb75b5b0f9a2c3472a7539c0bb5f12816739ad2c237dea22764b732def61f66b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfcf6069580c7aed47315635",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天比平时更充分地\n舒展了身体筋脉。照这个状态，\n训练也要继续努力呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21226a590acf6370f748af144cfc3ae74361847d0ad8743bcbc9046bed837795",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:184cb7d6aeafc724e99485e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这份努力，一定会\n连结到某个人的希望——\n这个想法鼓舞着我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e19c056a369cae9d31d2b14f01ac8dc59cec7e7703c36ab6ca7b8fa1c028962",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32b8924ffaac47b083662fd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我准备了无花果干\n用来补充营养。训练之后，\n要不要一起吃一些？",
      "source_fingerprint": "463124d8d3ca05ca1a1610f83d98e786c5e254ee5bd1a539a23b7187ec6a358c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:522f12ea686a44e96625a06c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到其他孩子训练的样子，\n我会得到力量——下一次，\n我也想把力量传递给大家。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97d2b113195be6bbbff8eb385e11950344579ed4970decaaf2e28ce3c56e2495",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd34acf22853149529011487",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始之前…我可以先喝一口\n带来的红茶吗？\n我想稍微平复一下心情…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5588ca0aba079de0c76371e44d80889c1b817408ced2b0c372e09f5ceb7618b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8e7aef36e456800db1861fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不要焦急，冷静下来…。\n不要让专注之线中断…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2715ab24914d71fb020d370c1ef64d5a7206ceec1c68e0fbcc7a95b34054dfd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f70688182bfb2b2a5c01152d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是怎么回事呢，这种感觉…。\n就像是腿上，\n缠绕着丝线一样…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14236e238a8f8766a9acfaa0baefbd2b5df84cf8c7dca2f589cdb0e68e7313fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e4872b059a1e1735c158c0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…有点怀念万籁争鸣同学\n那充满活力的音色了…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f45a7673a7ef043f135a62accc9c160ee48475951972053918682cd127c776b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67fda35741ea005192963fac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要稍微停下来休息一下？\n疲劳积累起来的话，心中的线\n也会松弛下来…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac5b7b23ea7a81da252110f3e67385a8f3a5431b78f3d76128806ae977923684",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:167536d9a13a8e35fbe7b718",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果你感到焦虑的话…\n请告诉我。让我们一起重新思考\n接下来该如何前进吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed0440c863ff3f497278754c19dfca02ccc5334cc1d13ff73a1ade9a4a12ce1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bce5c4ffbd14c190de815f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，我们出发吧。\n愿我的奔跑，能让观看的人们\n心意相连，成为一个『圆环』——",
      "source_fingerprint": "195f7e380d88520f877967283b4f6fde79f4e961b58ad54e42b0bf187e18f5cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d3486c8522c5b04d0e5f10a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的比赛…我相信着。\n相信你我二人一起推导出的，\n通向希望的方程式——",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b31118ff18aba0599d8e5ebc344ce1c1cf51e07f470d9ffa0b4b1a2aee8004f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2163f962a7e3b97d16d2142",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体非常轻盈。\n与你共同积累的日子，如今仿佛\n化作了编织希望的羽翼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b747cd092c0e8add3632afbfa5ad4c5ef5945b5390c50993075cce1d6e389a5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cbaf4af72d2430cd24f1a74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定会传达到的。传达那\n种能在某人心中点亮光芒的——\n奔跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4f17373209508db638a112ca6e408c68c7db385a4571a7ab81bf50e32cca9ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63c87824efb41f1dd8c708ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "——我看见了。冲线的瞬间…\n大家发出欢呼，心意合而为一的\n身影——…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4532be5df2a560f09af6b4b784f2bc7fef23c4ad9a275b2064d58ae7ad859172",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8883af6ba6373167ef6a79f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来的路上，熟识的小猫\n给了我鼓励的话。\n它说『比赛要加油哦』…呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d9cac190f9848466d92271ca137d9a199a12de5cd5ba485e8648f8dea27a708",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33dda319d0357dd6ea9cd2bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态和平时没有区别。所以今天\n也请你好好看着。看着与你一同编织的日子所结出的成果——",
      "source_fingerprint": "1de7e611ccad5e0741c1c730a65448088338c0df057d8f67065df0f996779d67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3249dfdd148163a52f42154b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欢呼声…已经传到这里了呢。\n把胸中回响的心意化作力量，\n——希望之环，我会继续连结下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8db49258a1a2c762b1bce3f860513b16a0200eb0b4d5cf4b5d28142932cad8c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b238b580919c7649de3688d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会握着绿松石祈祷。\n愿出赛的大家，\n都能平安地跑完全程…",
      "source_fingerprint": "84875fda70aed74ce572d5e3164bdcffe7352fcec3253b25f14c4f329e5543a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccd20ba65c2b18514b01d640",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸——…呼——…。\n…愿至今积累起来的一切，\n能够连结到未来…",
      "source_fingerprint": "80e7c2e617db572a82b2c8b99aa5fe66409ecd2528e64adc723d20bfcc215327",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e88300e905909abd4097d5e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不要着急，先放松身体\n再出发吧。今天也一定\n能跑出好表现的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e7fda8b66a280d8cbfe1fd39923c5cd5c3a0c615408d7459836a8ff3a1d76b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27fbc3c0f7b89b5832f056d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因为是在出赛前，才更要微笑呢。\n若要在心中点亮光芒，首先，\n我们自己就必须成为那道光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e50990c81ef8e5ba9803b39c471ef3997a56579f8c27f8a66e4608930daaa4e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0bb9c0e3710c762d1576861",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…没事的…。凭这次奔跑…\n一定能把希望…编织出来…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f7a784dd92e075e69836788a0ac8b015557ca1118c482194f6c4b35d6575081",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2567f1d3ee064d6c267ac047",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…呼。\n肩膀深处还稍微有些僵硬呢。\n…再稍微慢慢转动一下…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05c6f82b256d966e9aad7e8c8688246138e5d0e639f81e0f8c2244e49d59fbcf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0062372599350003d6a1bc4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽说还称不上万全…但希望\n始终就在我们身边。\n请不要担心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "477df0016064a29eeb6d6765300a4b31e653d01acbcd064782fde8b3c7ac227c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c23c96f31e1b14b2acde4201",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拜托了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69dce43a1e83db8317414d94819a56690e2f8869762928420aca26a49bd4a3fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d10d75121e90ba1e030899b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5340d32cafefeb07fb71f273be0d9e41c17a0c3f97ce3ec0784aa70ad39fd299",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f9a9384d53748c17e62915c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5af41dba62d130b44655e117242c6fb57d53e5d0bb265cfc362d0f9488cac6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9342f914c2966c28e1477da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "集中…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dd0b816c66daf32a658d5954190b89da51361bfe863198fcba39354583245d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:473898842aefb4ea35859110",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么会…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "406fcad51e4f61af30c23ee8e701c6d35fc07ed87dbb3ec812c403d8729568e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d6b63471635f9316a7bbbc6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d1781fc5f3f2aabe9eb0ac8829be6b9368cb1ffaf566104e3a77272c2aafbd5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f99ca41e9e57187603de983",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0f0665e0a69c08888c3252e4588492414e62eb2a101e0b2a5a81f3189d824bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb2e1c96fdec8f1b2b885472",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好舒服的风…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4a81f129ec7b2f3f75c94f3c3c9ac724be2be415c422afbfddba8b17b710ef6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:725741afe3175a83c28d8726",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多亏了你，我才能把希望连结起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb1c1ff01aa17ad4bdea6f4bb08e741cda086184dd61a8f83b19968720f56501",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff90201bc8dbd2358beff952",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢你一路陪我到这里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "956dbc965ec54cd13dacf14188d66c097f88e1204232e03b777fa387769a10f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f60497854ee14f7001bd75a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们将心连在一起吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "891e42aed401f8ceacf6420ea1aa0882c67c9257ca14ee2c2683d89555f83eaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c3d2cef1a88dd8360b0d2d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一起努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3382cddefb3b5851054894026cb53f29316b7430069927058d0134d0bb83b496",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1143",
        "2030"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
